<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Memorandum Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .header-info {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Office of Chief Counsel</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 0;">Internal Revenue Service</h2>
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 0;">Memorandum</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="header-info">
    <p>Number: <span data-field="document_number">{{ document_number }}</span></p>
    <p>Release Date: <span data-field="release_date">{{ release_date }}</span></p>
    <p>CC: <span data-field="cc_list">{{ cc_list }}</span></p>
    <p>POSTU-ID: <span data-field="postu_id">{{ postu_id }}</span></p>
    <p>UILC: <span data-field="uilc">{{ uilc }}</span></p>
    <p>Date: <span data-field="memo_date">{{ memo_date }}</span></p>
    <p>To: <span data-field="recipient_name">{{ recipient_name }}</span> (<span data-field="recipient_details">{{ recipient_details }}</span>)</p>
    <p>From: <span data-field="sender_name">{{ sender_name }}</span> (<span data-field="sender_department">{{ sender_department }}</span>)</p>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <p>Subject: <span data-field="subject_matter">{{ subject_matter }}</span></p>
  <p>This memorandum responds to your request for assistance. This advice may not be used or cited as precedent.</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">LEGEND</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">Taxpayer</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">Partnership</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">Date 1</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">Date 2</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">Parent</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">a</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">b</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; padding: 3px 0;">=</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="section-title">ISSUE</h3>
  <p><span data-field="issue_description">{{ issue_description }}</span></p>

  <h3 class="section-title">CONCLUSION</h3>
  <p><span data-field="conclusion_summary">{{ conclusion_summary }}</span></p>

  <h3 class="section-title">FACTS</h3>
  <p><span data-field="facts_narrative">{{ facts_narrative }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">POSTU-ID-122684-12</p>
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">2</p>
  <p><span data-field="c_field">{{ c_field }}</span> =</p>
  <p><span data-field="d_field">{{ d_field }}</span> =</p>
  <p><span data-field="e_field">{{ e_field }}</span> =</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">ISSUE</h3>
  <p><span data-field="issue_description_page2">{{ issue_description_page2 }}</span></p>

  <h3 class="section-title">CONCLUSION</h3>
  <p><span data-field="conclusion_summary_page2">{{ conclusion_summary_page2 }}</span></p>

  <h3 class="section-title">FACTS</h3>
  <p><span data-field="facts_narrative_page2">{{ facts_narrative_page2 }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">POSTU-ID-122684-12</p>
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">3</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">LAW AND ANALYSIS</h3>
  <p><span data-field="law_analysis_text">{{ law_analysis_text }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">POSTU-ID-122684-12</p>
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">4</p>

  <p><span data-field="legal_citation_text">{{ legal_citation_text }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">POSTU-ID-122684-12</p>
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">5</p>

  <p><span data-field="case_development_text">{{ case_development_text }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">POSTU-ID-122684-12</p>
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">6</p>

  <p>This writing may contain privileged information. Any unauthorized disclosure of this writing may undermine the ability of the Internal Revenue Service to protect the privileged information. If disclosure is determined to be necessary, please contact this office for our views.</p>
  <p>Please call <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span> or <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span> at <span data-field="contact_phone_2">{{ contact_phone_2 }}</span> if you have any further questions.</p>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <p>Sincerely,</p>
    <br><br><br>
    <p>David R. Haglund</p>
    <p>Chief, Branch 1</p>
    <p>Office of the Associate Chief Counsel</p>
    <p>(Passthroughs & Special Industries)</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>